<Article
  title="Terms and legal context"
  description="A document register for Coinkite's Terms of Sale, the Ontario consumer statutes relevant to arbitration and class-proceeding clauses, and who is publicly organising claims."
  standfirst="What the published terms say, which Ontario statute e-Laws lists as in force, who is publicly gathering claimants, and what this archive cannot determine. This is not legal advice."
  depth="plain"
  kicker="Responses"
  next={{
    href: '/response/',
