          <tr><td class="nw">Warranty disclaimer</td><td class="wide">Section 16 describes products as sold on an "as-is" basis, subject to the maximum extent permitted by applicable law.</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="nw">Liability cap</td><td class="wide">Section 18 states that aggregate liability is limited to direct damages not exceeding the product purchase price, again to the maximum extent permitted by applicable law.</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="nw">Excluded damages</td><td class="wide">Section 18 excludes categories including consequential, incidental, indirect, special and punitive damages.</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="nw">Arbitration</td><td class="wide">Section 22 gives Coinkite the option to require final and binding arbitration in Toronto under Ontario's Arbitration Act, 1991.</td></tr>
